# Frozen fixture corpora and golden files under this directory are compared
# byte-for-byte by the test suite (see test_packer.py's fixture-based
# manifest proof). Without this, a checkout with `core.autocrlf=true` (the
# common Windows default) silently rewrites LF to CRLF on clone, changing
# every file's exact byte length and breaking token-count/manifest
# reproducibility for anyone but the machine that authored them.
#
# `-text` disables Git's newline normalization entirely for everything
# below this directory, so a fixture checks out identical to what was
# committed on every platform.
* -text
